the community go down and down and down to

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:19.250
the point where you would not have to have
those public health restrictions.

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:25.420
So it's almost paradoxical that on the one
hand, they want to be relieved of the restrictions,

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:27.879
but on the other hand, they don't want to
get vaccinated.

00:02:27.879 --> 00:02:29.690
It just almost doesn't make any sense.

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:35.299
